{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech is all that stands between you and what writhes below. <strong>FEED MY MECH</strong> is a short horror experience\u2014venture into a dead underground colony and recover lost tech. But something is spreading through the machines\u2026 and it\u2019s looking for a way inside your mech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.poster.avif?t=1764352156\" aria-label=\"Moving through what looks to be a tunnel.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.webm?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.mp4?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Kind of Horror:</strong>\u00a0You are trapped inside of a mechanical chassis, you can't move, you can't hide, you can't run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vision:</strong>\u00a0There are no windows to look beyond the cold metal walls of your mech. Make use of distorted, unreliable screens and maps to navigate the decaying environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Explore the remains on what could have been a prospering community and discover secrets that may hint to what went wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short Horror Experience:</strong> Can be completed in around two to three hours on the main path, but explore more if you wish, there are many secrets to find beyond that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.poster.avif?t=1764352156\" aria-label=\"Swapping to the target view to see infected remains of another mech.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.webm?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.mp4?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main portion of the gameplay is set within a mech provided by your employer, <i>Solance Systems</i>. They have tasked you with retrieving &quot;Signals&quot; from various remains of previous mech pilots in the area, any further information about your task is <strong>strictly confidential</strong>. Something goes wrong while you're down there, you are trapped in an old residential colony below your target location. While not intended, Solance tasks you with collecting the &quot;Signals&quot; on this lower, more hostile floor. <strong>They aren't carving an escape path for you until you do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.poster.avif?t=1764352156\" aria-label=\"Flipping up tablet and looking at a signal inventory entry.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.webm?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.mp4?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get the signals, get out, and maybe discover what <strong>actually</strong> happened to this residential colony on the way...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE DESCENT BEGINS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/350b14f1f1b4b7c476f35789fe3c77668eb694f2.jpg"},{"name":"CONFIGURATION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/fd9d6873859591c609a30af20a5d2217b100e54c.jpg"},{"name":"JUMPSCARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/39d30eade481a8509ce9a9cc0b4f0fe0a5f5e980.jpg"},{"name":"HUNT THEM DOWN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/60dbf412726dc7fb3fdb190c9bfabe85a37bfa78.jpg"},{"name":"THE HUNGER BEGINS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/e8834c9c07416599a934d87fabb48f572bfbcb5c.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST SIGNAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/2dc35833d462da1160a3723ea523093dd85a5ecc.jpg"},{"name":"LET THERE BE LIGHT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/1b50d5e54fe31ac467a515a09815ffc0b29e0980.jpg"},{"name":"FEED MY MECH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/5dc1e9d8a5093ab19745bf406892419566c24614.jpg"},{"name":"BAD ENDING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/0fe6adb0ceb90f6053caf3e09b06dc05c30861ee.jpg"},{"name":"TRUE ENDING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906110/d3d0f398e7ab2730e6bf3d6fd9a227239a4ab3e3.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906110?t=1764352156","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906110?t=1764352156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/39170b846cec6bd79bed638119512f7f6c989dfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764352156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/39170b846cec6bd79bed638119512f7f6c989dfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764352156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech is all that stands between you and what writhes below. <strong>FEED MY MECH</strong> is a short horror experience\u2014venture into a dead underground colony and recover lost tech. But something is spreading through the machines\u2026 and it\u2019s looking for a way inside your mech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.poster.avif?t=1764352156\" aria-label=\"Moving through what looks to be a tunnel.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.webm?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/e4de33a345079d56dfccbfc56348033a.mp4?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Kind of Horror:</strong>\u00a0You are trapped inside of a mechanical chassis, you can't move, you can't hide, you can't run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vision:</strong>\u00a0There are no windows to look beyond the cold metal walls of your mech. Make use of distorted, unreliable screens and maps to navigate the decaying environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Explore the remains on what could have been a prospering community and discover secrets that may hint to what went wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short Horror Experience:</strong> Can be completed in around two to three hours on the main path, but explore more if you wish, there are many secrets to find beyond that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.poster.avif?t=1764352156\" aria-label=\"Swapping to the target view to see infected remains of another mech.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.webm?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/353b527d82bb84d263d741fe61a8a872.mp4?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main portion of the gameplay is set within a mech provided by your employer, <i>Solance Systems</i>. They have tasked you with retrieving &quot;Signals&quot; from various remains of previous mech pilots in the area, any further information about your task is <strong>strictly confidential</strong>. Something goes wrong while you're down there, you are trapped in an old residential colony below your target location. While not intended, Solance tasks you with collecting the &quot;Signals&quot; on this lower, more hostile floor. <strong>They aren't carving an escape path for you until you do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.poster.avif?t=1764352156\" aria-label=\"Flipping up tablet and looking at a signal inventory entry.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.webm?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/extras/6c58f0536623a9502a2a6294e0b7bc54.mp4?t=1764352156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get the signals, get out, and maybe discover what <strong>actually</strong> happened to this residential colony on the way...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TheManiacMartian"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906110/edda4b9b78206230b24a1a9e76616b0ac5f74350/header.jpg?t=1764352156","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906110/995564050/3564772ac70dbcc4dde995dcb069259d6b6d1341/1764218402/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764219406","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906110/995564050/3564772ac70dbcc4dde995dcb069259d6b6d1341/1764218402